# Score B: notes copied from the English Wikipedia page at its URL, under CC BY-SA 4.0; the page is the attribution. Retrieved 2026-11-07, used only to compare, never served.
# Petrie's 1855 print ("Name unknown", from Miss J. Ross, Limavady), the source every later version descends from.
# Melody = stems-up top voice of the right hand. The familiar "Danny Boy" sheet (1913) may differ in places.
# Score B is an independent modern transcription (en.wikipedia LilyPond) of the same print, Petrie 1855;
# it counts as score B (controller ruling, 2026-11-07).
id londonderry-air
de Londonderry Air
en Danny Boy
aliases oh danny boy
tempo 76
bar 16
pickup 6
